WEBVTT

00:21.456 --> 00:24.328
[female voice]
Long ago, in ancient China,

00:24.502 --> 00:28.332
the Peacocks ruled
over Gongmen City.

00:28.506 --> 00:32.423
They brought great joy
and prosperity to the city,

00:32.597 --> 00:35.731
for they had
invented fireworks.

00:35.905 --> 00:37.907
[pops, whistling]

00:39.387 --> 00:42.172
But their son, Lord Shen,

00:42.346 --> 00:46.263
saw darker power
in the fireworks.

00:46.437 --> 00:49.397
What had brought
color and joy,

00:49.571 --> 00:53.923
could also bring darkness
and destruction.

00:54.097 --> 00:57.883
Shen's troubled parents
consulted a soothsayer.

00:58.058 --> 01:03.541
She foretold that if Shen
continued down this dark path

01:03.715 --> 01:09.156
he would be defeated by
a warrior of black and white.

01:09.330 --> 01:13.116
The young lord
set out to change his fate.

01:13.290 --> 01:15.553
But what he did next...

01:15.727 --> 01:18.600
...only sealed it.

01:22.647 --> 01:27.174
Shen returned to his parents,
full of pride.

01:27.348 --> 01:31.395
But in their faces,
he saw only horror.

01:33.136 --> 01:36.008
He was banished
from the city forever.

01:36.183 --> 01:39.534
But Shen swore revenge.

01:39.708 --> 01:42.450
Someday he would return,

01:42.624 --> 01:46.410
and all of China
would bow at his feet.

01:54.679 --> 01:56.333
[chains clanking]

02:06.517 --> 02:07.823
[grunts]

02:12.958 --> 02:14.438
[grunts]

02:17.963 --> 02:20.792
It's almost done, Lord Shen,
but we've run out of metal.

02:22.533 --> 02:26.842
Search the farthest villages!
Find more metal!

02:27.016 --> 02:28.974
China will be mine.

02:39.071 --> 02:42.379
And then the Dragon Warrior
joined the Furious Five!

02:42.553 --> 02:45.426
And they became the most
awesomest kung fu team ever!

02:45.600 --> 02:47.341
Enough talk. Let's fight!

02:47.515 --> 02:48.429
- Yah!
- Hi-yah!

02:48.603 --> 02:50.431
Listen, listen.

02:50.605 --> 02:52.084
You can hear
the Dragon Warrior
training right now!

02:52.259 --> 02:54.174
- [Viper] 33.
- [Mantis] Stop him!

02:54.348 --> 02:56.176
- It's too dangerous!
- [Tigress] 35.

02:56.350 --> 02:59.527
- Stay focused!
- [Viper] 36, 37!

02:59.701 --> 03:02.007
How is he doing that
with his face?

03:02.182 --> 03:04.184
[strains]

03:05.968 --> 03:08.536
[muffled] 38 bean buns!

03:08.710 --> 03:11.278
Yes! New record!
You monster!

03:11.452 --> 03:14.063
- Keep going! Hit 40!
- He'll never hit 40.

03:14.237 --> 03:16.021
[muffled] You guys wait,
we'll get to 40!

03:16.196 --> 03:17.327
Do it.

03:17.501 --> 03:19.373
No problem!

03:19.547 --> 03:20.852
Yeah!

03:21.897 --> 03:23.507
Yeah!!

03:23.681 --> 03:24.639
[grunts]

03:24.813 --> 03:26.989
[muffled] Give me a minute.

03:27.163 --> 03:28.773
- [laughing]
- Yeah!

03:28.947 --> 03:30.645
- Yes!
- He did it!

03:30.819 --> 03:32.516
Well done, Po!

03:32.690 --> 03:35.040
- [laughter]
- Your training has paid off.

03:35.215 --> 03:37.217
- [distant gong]
- Oh, Master Shifu!

03:37.391 --> 03:39.393
- Gotta go. See you later!
- Ooh, yeah!

03:39.567 --> 03:41.525
You'll save those for me,
right?

03:43.310 --> 03:45.268
[Po grunting]

03:48.793 --> 03:50.752
[grunting]

03:54.321 --> 03:56.061
[water dripping]

03:56.236 --> 03:58.934
[exhaling, inhaling]

04:01.980 --> 04:03.460
Inner peace.

04:03.634 --> 04:06.071
[exhales]

04:06.246 --> 04:08.857
- Inner peace.
- [approaching footsteps]

04:09.031 --> 04:10.859
- [splashing]
- [Po grunting]

04:11.033 --> 04:14.210
[Shifu groaning] Inner peace.

04:14.384 --> 04:16.604
Master Shifu.

04:16.778 --> 04:18.823
Master Shifu,
what do we got?

04:18.997 --> 04:21.696
Pirates?
Vandals of Volcano Mountain?

04:21.870 --> 04:26.048
Whatever it is,
I will take them down,
'cause I am in a mood.

04:26.222 --> 04:29.443
I need to get something done,
you know what I mean?

04:29.617 --> 04:31.749
Uh, what are you doing?

04:31.923 --> 04:35.623
One of Master Oogway's
final teachings.

05:03.825 --> 05:04.956
[gasps] Whoa!

05:05.130 --> 05:07.568
[chuckles] Awesome!

05:07.742 --> 05:10.092
How did you do that?

05:10.266 --> 05:12.094
Inner peace.

05:12.268 --> 05:15.489
Inner piece. That's cool.

05:15.663 --> 05:17.273
Inner piece of what?

05:17.447 --> 05:19.362
It is the next phase
of your training.

05:19.536 --> 05:23.758
Every master
must find his path

05:23.932 --> 05:25.760
to inner peace.

05:25.934 --> 05:30.112
Some choose to meditate
for 50 years in a cave
just like this...

05:31.809 --> 05:34.769
...without the slightest taste
of food or water.

05:34.943 --> 05:36.466
[stomach grumbles]

05:36.640 --> 05:38.207
Or?

05:38.381 --> 05:41.384
Some find it through pain
and suffering as I did.

05:41.558 --> 05:44.909
Po, the day you were chosen
as Dragon Warrior

05:45.083 --> 05:46.737
was the worst day of my life.

05:46.911 --> 05:48.260
By far.

05:48.435 --> 05:50.306
Nothing else came close.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.569
It was the worst,
most painful,

05:52.743 --> 05:54.876
mind-destroying,
horrible moment...

05:55.050 --> 05:57.400
- OK.
- ...I have ever experienced.

05:58.836 --> 06:01.361
[shivers]

06:01.535 --> 06:05.756
But once I realized
the problem was not you,
but within me,

06:05.930 --> 06:07.541
I found inner peace,

06:07.715 --> 06:11.371
and was able to harness
the flow of the universe.

06:11.545 --> 06:14.069
So that's it?
I just need inner peace?

06:14.243 --> 06:16.332
My innards are already
super, super peaceful,

06:16.506 --> 06:20.031
so all I need to do
is just get this thing going.

06:20.205 --> 06:22.077
Inner peace,
you're going down.

06:22.251 --> 06:23.992
Now show me what you were
doing there with your feet.

06:24.166 --> 06:25.385
I saw you do sort of
a fancy foot...

06:25.559 --> 06:27.038
Po! Bandits!

06:27.212 --> 06:28.475
Approaching
the musicians' village.

06:28.649 --> 06:30.302
Danger.
Tell those musicians

06:30.477 --> 06:31.956
to start playing
some action music,

06:32.130 --> 06:33.958
because it is on.

06:34.132 --> 06:36.265
Don't worry, Shifu,
I'll master inner peace
as soon as I get back.

06:36.439 --> 06:38.963
- No snack stops this time.
- [laughing]

06:39.137 --> 06:41.009
Snack stops.
[blows raspberry]

06:41.183 --> 06:42.837
Wait, are you serious?

06:44.447 --> 06:45.927
[bell gongs]

06:46.101 --> 06:47.407
[shouting]

06:50.453 --> 06:53.108
- [yelling]
- [growling]

06:55.240 --> 06:58.113
Get all the metal
you can find!

07:01.551 --> 07:03.466
Grab the metal!

07:04.467 --> 07:05.642
[shouting]

07:06.991 --> 07:09.994
- [sobbing]
- Help, help, help, help!

07:12.301 --> 07:13.911
[shrieks]

07:14.085 --> 07:16.000
That's everything!
Let's get out of here.

07:16.174 --> 07:17.219
OK.

07:17.393 --> 07:18.655
- Oh, no.
- [grunts]

07:18.829 --> 07:20.614
[high-pitched cry]

07:23.878 --> 07:26.837
Wings of Justice!
[yelling]

07:27.751 --> 07:30.145
[screaming]

07:31.668 --> 07:32.930
Po!

07:33.496 --> 07:35.672
Yee-hah!

07:40.242 --> 07:42.113
- [all] Hah!
- Hmm?

07:42.287 --> 07:43.637
Ha-ha!

07:43.811 --> 07:45.987
- [cheering]
- The Dragon Warrior!

07:46.161 --> 07:48.380
The panda?
That's impossible.

07:48.555 --> 07:50.339
My fist hungers for justice.

07:50.513 --> 07:51.688
[grumbling]

07:51.862 --> 07:53.385
- That was my... fist.
- [groans]

07:53.560 --> 07:54.952
Get 'em!

07:55.126 --> 07:57.085
- Come on!
- Yeah!

08:00.697 --> 08:02.351
[all] Ooh!

08:03.613 --> 08:05.223
- [clanging]
- [all] Yay!

08:08.357 --> 08:09.532
[groans]

08:09.706 --> 08:12.100
[plays stringed instrument]

08:19.194 --> 08:20.500
Take that!

08:27.419 --> 08:29.509
[clattering]

08:31.032 --> 08:32.424
Po! Incoming!

08:32.599 --> 08:33.948
Thanks, Mantis!

08:34.122 --> 08:35.166
[growling]

08:36.472 --> 08:37.429
[groans]

08:37.604 --> 08:39.519
[plays stringed instrument]

08:41.912 --> 08:42.870
[yelps]

08:45.960 --> 08:47.483
[growling]

08:51.531 --> 08:52.749
[growling and snarling]

08:52.923 --> 08:54.882
Tigress, Double Death Strike!

09:02.063 --> 09:03.368
[Po] Ye-aargh!

09:03.543 --> 09:06.110
- Feet of Fury!
- Aaargh!

09:06.284 --> 09:09.026
[all cry out]

09:09.200 --> 09:10.288
Tigress!

09:10.462 --> 09:11.420
Monkey!

09:11.594 --> 09:13.596
Viper! Mantis!

09:13.770 --> 09:16.294
- Bunny! What?
- [continues playing]

09:16.468 --> 09:17.557
Oh, sorry.

09:18.775 --> 09:20.734
[howls]

09:23.563 --> 09:25.390
[screams] Help!

09:25.565 --> 09:27.697
- Crane, go!
- I'm on it!

09:30.526 --> 09:31.875
Ahh!

09:33.268 --> 09:34.269
Hoo!

09:35.009 --> 09:36.750
Whoa!

09:40.275 --> 09:42.320
[straining]

09:46.890 --> 09:48.805
Is everyone OK?

09:48.979 --> 09:50.938
- [cheering]
- Awesome!

09:53.549 --> 09:54.811
I got this.

10:01.252 --> 10:03.515
[crying]

10:05.953 --> 10:06.910
Po!

10:09.130 --> 10:10.087
Oof!

10:11.698 --> 10:12.786
[all cry out]

10:13.700 --> 10:15.136
Chew on that, tubby!

10:15.310 --> 10:16.833
Ha-ha, ha-ha-ha!

10:18.618 --> 10:20.315
Ha-ha, ha-ha-ha!

10:22.534 --> 10:24.972
[grunts and groans]

10:25.146 --> 10:27.148
- Are you OK?
- What happened?

10:28.802 --> 10:30.499
I think I saw...

10:30.673 --> 10:33.850
I think... I gotta go.

10:36.592 --> 10:38.333
Thank you.
Thank you for coming

10:38.507 --> 10:42.206
to Dragon Warrior Noodles
and Tofu.

10:42.380 --> 10:44.121
- More tea? Lemon sauce?
- No.

10:44.295 --> 10:46.950
If you need anything,
just ask.

10:47.908 --> 10:50.214
- Thank you.
- Feet of Fury!

10:50.388 --> 10:53.478
Ah, the Dragon Warrior's mop.

10:53.653 --> 10:55.219
He mopped these very floors!

10:55.393 --> 10:58.614
Uh, uh... No touching!
You'll get the mop dirty.

10:59.702 --> 11:01.573
- He once waited on me.
- Awesome!

11:01.748 --> 11:03.184
Yeah,
I have the stain to prove it.

11:03.358 --> 11:05.447
Hey, where is
the Dragon Warrior?

11:05.621 --> 11:08.232
He doesn't work here anymore.

11:08.406 --> 11:11.192
He's busy out there
protecting the Valley.

11:11.366 --> 11:13.498
- [gasps] The Dragon Warrior!
- There he is.

11:13.673 --> 11:15.370
- Po!
- Wow!

11:16.240 --> 11:17.764
Uh... Uh, here.

11:17.938 --> 11:19.287
- [giggling]
- OK, OK.

11:19.461 --> 11:20.505
You should have
told me you were coming.

11:20.680 --> 11:22.029
Hi, Dad.

11:22.203 --> 11:23.944
I would have saved you some
stinky tofu.

11:24.118 --> 11:25.685
Uh... Uh...

11:25.859 --> 11:29.471
- Dad, can I talk to you?
- Of course, son.

11:29.645 --> 11:34.258
In honor of my son,
free tofu dessert
for everybody!

11:34.432 --> 11:36.043
- [cheering]
- With purchases.

11:36.217 --> 11:37.218
[all groan]

11:37.392 --> 11:41.004
Oh, it's so good
to see you, Po.

11:41.178 --> 11:44.747
Have you lost weight? I can
almost put my wings
around you.

11:44.921 --> 11:46.575
Ah, well, maybe a little.

11:46.749 --> 11:49.056
Poor you, you must feel weak.

11:49.230 --> 11:51.667
- Let me get you some soup.
- No, that's OK, Dad.

11:51.841 --> 11:53.713
- I'm not hungry.
- Not hungry?

11:53.887 --> 11:55.453
Po, are you all right?

11:55.627 --> 11:57.368
Yeah. No, I'm fine.
I just...

11:57.542 --> 11:59.544
Earlier today,
I was fighting these bandits.

11:59.719 --> 12:02.199
- Uh-huh.
- Nothing too dangerous.

12:02.373 --> 12:04.027
- They were just, you know...
- Yeah.

12:04.201 --> 12:06.247
And then the strangest thing
happened.

12:06.421 --> 12:08.336
I had this crazy vision.

12:08.510 --> 12:11.556
I think I saw my mom
and me... as a baby.

12:11.731 --> 12:14.864
What? Huh?
Mom? A baby?

12:15.038 --> 12:19.564
- Um, Dad?
- What are you talking about?

12:19.739 --> 12:21.566
- What...?
- How do I say this?

12:21.741 --> 12:23.090
[whimpers]

12:23.264 --> 12:25.222
Where did I come from?

12:29.183 --> 12:34.797
Well, you see, uh, son, baby
geese come from a little egg.

12:34.971 --> 12:37.104
Don't ask me
where the egg comes from.

12:37.278 --> 12:39.759
Dad, that's not what I meant.

12:41.108 --> 12:43.284
I know it's not.

12:43.458 --> 12:48.332
I think it's time I told you
something I should have told
you a long time ago.

12:49.333 --> 12:50.595
OK.

12:50.770 --> 12:53.598
You might have been kind of...

12:53.773 --> 12:56.123
...a... a... a...

12:58.081 --> 12:59.735
...adopted.

12:59.909 --> 13:01.737
- I knew it.
- You knew?

13:01.911 --> 13:04.958
- Well, who told you?
- No one. I mean,
come on, Dad.

13:05.132 --> 13:07.699
But if you knew, why didn't
you ever say anything?

13:07.874 --> 13:09.832
Why didn't you say anything?

13:12.182 --> 13:14.881
How did I get here, Dad?
Where did I come from?

13:16.665 --> 13:20.016
Actually, you came from this.

13:24.064 --> 13:26.849
It was just another day
at the restaurant.

13:27.023 --> 13:29.243
Time to make the noodles.

13:29.417 --> 13:31.027
I went out to the back

13:31.201 --> 13:33.987
where my vegetables
had just been delivered.

13:34.161 --> 13:36.816
There were cabbages,
turnips, radishes.

13:38.034 --> 13:40.645
Only there were no radishes...

13:40.820 --> 13:44.171
...just a very hungry
baby panda.

13:45.433 --> 13:46.869
Whee!

13:47.043 --> 13:49.002
There was no note.

13:49.176 --> 13:51.352
Of course,
you could have eaten it.

13:51.526 --> 13:56.009
I waited for someone to come
looking for you
but no one did.

13:56.183 --> 13:58.054
[Po gurgles]

13:59.316 --> 14:01.275
[crying]

14:10.762 --> 14:12.721
[gurgles]

14:20.163 --> 14:22.122
[Ping] I brought you inside.

14:24.689 --> 14:25.995
Fed you.

14:27.736 --> 14:29.129
Gave you a bath.

14:32.219 --> 14:34.438
And fed you again.

14:36.658 --> 14:38.921
And again.

14:39.095 --> 14:40.357
[playful whine]

14:40.531 --> 14:43.143
And tried to
put some pants on you.

14:46.886 --> 14:48.888
[sobs and whimpers]

14:51.978 --> 14:55.198
And then I made a decision
that would change
my life forever.

14:57.940 --> 15:00.029
To make my soup
without radishes...

15:01.204 --> 15:04.425
...and to raise you
as my own son.

15:05.643 --> 15:09.734
Xiao Po, my little panda.

15:09.909 --> 15:15.349
And from that moment on,
both my soup and my life

15:15.523 --> 15:18.613
have been that much sweeter.

15:18.787 --> 15:21.833
And, little Po,
that's the end of the story.

15:22.008 --> 15:24.184
Ha! Look at me.

15:24.358 --> 15:26.229
No, don't look at me.

15:26.403 --> 15:29.450
That's it? That can't be it.

15:29.624 --> 15:31.582
There's gotta be more, Dad!

15:31.756 --> 15:35.151
Well, there was the time
you ate
all my bamboo furniture.

15:35.325 --> 15:37.849
It was imported, too.

15:38.024 --> 15:40.591
One dumpling, please,
Dragon Warrior size.

15:40.765 --> 15:42.767
[grunts]

15:46.162 --> 15:49.992
Oh, Po, your story may
not have such
a happy beginning,

15:50.166 --> 15:51.689
but look how it turned out.

15:51.863 --> 15:54.127
You got me. You got kung fu.

15:54.301 --> 15:55.606
And you got noodles.

15:55.780 --> 15:58.435
I know. I just have
so many questions.

15:58.609 --> 16:01.003
Like, how did I ever fit
in this tiny basket?

16:01.177 --> 16:02.831
Why didn't I like pants?

16:05.181 --> 16:07.140
And who am I?

16:12.928 --> 16:14.147
[grunting]

16:14.321 --> 16:16.279
[male voice] Good.
Watch your form.

16:18.978 --> 16:20.370
Good.

16:22.024 --> 16:23.983
Better. Elbow.

16:24.984 --> 16:26.986
Straighten it out!

16:35.995 --> 16:38.040
[all grunting, shouting]

16:38.214 --> 16:40.477
[all cry out in pain]

16:53.055 --> 16:54.970
Shen?

16:55.144 --> 16:58.104
Good afternoon, gentlemen.

16:58.278 --> 17:00.889
Now we've got the
pleasantries out of the way,

17:01.063 --> 17:03.065
please leave my house.

17:03.239 --> 17:05.372
- Your house?
- Yes.

17:05.546 --> 17:07.983
Didn't you see the peacock
on the front door?

17:08.940 --> 17:12.074
Ah, there you are, Soothsayer.

17:12.248 --> 17:17.471
It seems your fortune-telling
skills are not as good
as you thought.

17:17.645 --> 17:21.605
- We shall see, Shen.
- No, you shall see, old goat.

17:21.779 --> 17:24.347
- Where were we?
- What do you want, Shen?

17:24.521 --> 17:27.437
What is rightfully mine.

17:27.611 --> 17:29.526
Gongmen City!

17:29.700 --> 17:31.833
Gongmen is under
the stewardship
of the Masters' Council

17:32.007 --> 17:33.356
and we will protect it.

17:33.530 --> 17:35.793
Even from you.

17:35.967 --> 17:40.320
[chuckles] I'm so glad
you feel that way.

17:40.494 --> 17:43.279
Otherwise, I'd have dragged
that here for nothing.

17:43.453 --> 17:45.499
What's in the box, Shen?

17:45.673 --> 17:48.589
You want to see? It's a gift.

17:49.459 --> 17:51.113
It's your parting gift.

17:51.287 --> 17:53.159
In that it will part you.

17:53.333 --> 17:54.943
Part of you here,
part of you there

17:55.117 --> 17:58.990
and part of you way over
there, staining the wall!

17:59.165 --> 18:00.470
You insolent fool!

18:00.644 --> 18:01.645
[grunts]

18:18.836 --> 18:19.881
Show-off.

18:20.055 --> 18:21.578
That is a warning.

18:21.752 --> 18:24.712
You are no match
for our kung fu.

18:24.886 --> 18:26.801
I agree.

18:26.975 --> 18:28.629
But this is.

18:36.941 --> 18:37.942
[metallic snarl]

18:42.730 --> 18:45.385
Are you familiar with
the Master of Gongmen City?

18:45.559 --> 18:47.126
- Master Thundering Rhino?
- Yes.

18:47.300 --> 18:49.737
- Son of Legendary
Flying Rhino?
- Yes.

18:49.911 --> 18:52.870
And Slayer of the Ten Thousand
Serpents in the Valley of Woe?

18:53.044 --> 18:55.003
- He's dead.
- Whoa.

18:55.177 --> 18:57.005
[Crane] That's impossible.

18:57.179 --> 18:59.050
Rhino's Horn Defense
is impervious
to any technique.

18:59.225 --> 19:02.880
It was no technique.
Lord Shen has created
a weapon.

19:03.054 --> 19:05.144
One that breathes fire
and spits metal.

19:05.318 --> 19:07.711
Unless he is stopped,

19:07.885 --> 19:10.714
this could be
the end of kung fu.

19:10.888 --> 19:15.415
- But I just got kung fu!
- And now you must save it.

19:15.589 --> 19:19.549
Go! Destroy this weapon
and bring Lord Shen
to justice!

19:19.723 --> 19:21.377
OK, here we go!
Here we go!

19:21.551 --> 19:23.771
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Wait a second.

19:23.945 --> 19:24.859
How can I do this?

19:25.033 --> 19:26.077
I mean,
how can kung fu

19:26.252 --> 19:28.079
stop something
that stops kung fu?

19:28.254 --> 19:29.951
Remember, Dragon Warrior,

19:30.125 --> 19:33.694
anything is possible
when you have inner peace.

19:37.219 --> 19:38.177
[cheering]

19:39.700 --> 19:41.919
Inner peace. Inner peace.
Inner peace.

19:42.093 --> 19:44.052
[exhales] Peace on.

19:44.226 --> 19:46.228
- [Ping] Oh, Po?
- Peace!

19:46.402 --> 19:48.622
Oh, Po, I got you
a travel pack.

19:48.796 --> 19:52.016
I packed you food for weeks.
Cookies, buns, vegetables.

19:52.191 --> 19:55.106
I even packed all your
action figures. See?

19:55.281 --> 19:56.934
[guffaws]

19:57.108 --> 19:59.763
Oh, uh... Hey,
I don't know what those are.

19:59.937 --> 20:01.591
Never seen them before
in my life.

20:01.765 --> 20:03.724
Dad, you got scratches
on my Tigress.

20:03.898 --> 20:06.727
I also packed your paintings
of our best time together,

20:06.901 --> 20:09.425
just in case you get lonely.

20:09.599 --> 20:11.427
That's me and you
making noodles.

20:11.601 --> 20:13.473
And that's me and you
eating noodles.

20:13.647 --> 20:17.346
And that's me giving
you a piggyback ride.

20:17.520 --> 20:20.610
Isn't that cute?
On second thought,
I'll hang on to this one.

20:20.784 --> 20:22.699
Hey, uh...
they're waiting for me.

20:22.873 --> 20:26.355
Of course, of course.
You have a job to do...

20:26.529 --> 20:28.009
...far from home,

20:28.183 --> 20:30.272
in a strange city,
filled with strange people,

20:30.446 --> 20:31.708
and strange noodles,

20:31.882 --> 20:32.970
facing horrible danger

20:33.144 --> 20:35.495
from which you
might never return!

20:35.669 --> 20:36.931
Don't go, Po.

20:37.105 --> 20:39.368
I gotta go.
I'm the Dragon Warrior.

20:39.542 --> 20:41.805
It's kind of my job
to save kung fu.

20:41.979 --> 20:44.939
And if I don't...
what am I?

20:45.113 --> 20:47.115
You're my son.

20:50.118 --> 20:51.119
Right?

20:52.729 --> 20:55.602
- [Tigress] Po, it's time.
- Um, goodbye.

20:57.865 --> 20:59.345
Don't worry, Mr. Ping.

20:59.519 --> 21:01.825
He'll be back
before you can say "noodles".

21:07.527 --> 21:09.485
Noodles.

21:15.926 --> 21:17.798
Come on, guys, let's go!

21:17.972 --> 21:19.147
Yeah!

21:21.149 --> 21:23.543
[panting and groaning]

21:23.717 --> 21:25.240
Yeah, yeah.

21:25.414 --> 21:26.459
Yeah...

21:40.342 --> 21:41.300
[Po] Oh!

21:42.388 --> 21:44.172
[Po grunting]

21:45.347 --> 21:47.523
[Po howling]

21:54.922 --> 21:56.706
[grunts] Ooh.

21:56.880 --> 21:59.535
[exhales and strains]

22:40.054 --> 22:41.708
[sighs]

22:42.578 --> 22:44.319
[chuckles]

22:46.060 --> 22:47.540
Mama?

22:52.980 --> 22:54.460
Mom? Dad?

22:54.634 --> 22:55.765
Is that you?

22:55.939 --> 22:58.072
Mom! Dad!

22:59.987 --> 23:02.250
Oh, hi. Hey, son.
You're back.

23:02.424 --> 23:03.860
Huh?

23:04.034 --> 23:05.775
Honey, what are you
doing here?

23:05.949 --> 23:07.560
But I thought...

23:07.734 --> 23:10.084
We've replaced you, dear,
with this lovely radish.

23:11.259 --> 23:12.303
Radish?

23:12.478 --> 23:14.305
It's quiet, polite,
and frankly,

23:14.480 --> 23:16.482
does better kung fu.

23:16.656 --> 23:18.745
- [squeaks]
- No. No, no, no.

23:22.836 --> 23:24.794
Wait! [grunting]

23:27.362 --> 23:29.538
- [groans]
- [squeaks]

23:29.712 --> 23:31.671
- Hi-yah!
- No!

23:32.498 --> 23:33.673
[cries out]

23:39.679 --> 23:42.203
Radish, radish, radish.

23:42.377 --> 23:43.596
[growls] Yah!

23:50.864 --> 23:52.996
Inner pea... [grunts]

23:55.608 --> 23:57.392
Pea... [clears throat]

23:57.566 --> 23:58.872
P...

23:59.046 --> 24:00.482
Inner peace.

24:00.656 --> 24:02.571
[dripping]

24:02.745 --> 24:03.964
Aaah!

24:04.791 --> 24:06.793
[yells]

24:13.887 --> 24:16.890
[prolonged yell]

24:17.064 --> 24:21.677
Inner peace! Inner peace!
Inner peace! Inner peace,
inner peace...!

24:21.851 --> 24:23.287
[Tigress clears throat]

24:26.203 --> 24:29.772
Oh. Uh, I'm, uh, training.

24:29.946 --> 24:32.166
The mast is not
a worthy opponent.

24:35.909 --> 24:38.259
- I am ready.
- OK.

24:38.433 --> 24:40.435
So serious.

24:41.697 --> 24:44.744
[impact echoes]

24:45.571 --> 24:47.790
Ha-ha-ow!

24:47.964 --> 24:50.967
- I think I prefer the mast.
- Apologies.

24:51.141 --> 24:55.102
I used to punch the ironwood
trees by the palace to train.

24:55.276 --> 24:56.582
Now I feel nothing.

24:57.626 --> 24:59.585
That's severely cool.

25:02.544 --> 25:03.937
Again!

25:04.111 --> 25:05.939
Hah!

25:06.113 --> 25:09.072
So, uh, this
punching ironwood trees,

25:09.246 --> 25:10.857
how long did you
have to do that?

25:11.031 --> 25:14.251
- Twenty years.
- Oh. Twenty...
Twenty years? [groans]

25:14.425 --> 25:16.645
Is there any, uh,
you know, faster way?

25:16.819 --> 25:19.474
You know, until you, uh,
you know...
don't feel anything?

25:19.648 --> 25:20.606
No.

25:20.780 --> 25:22.738
- Besides...
- [shouts]

25:25.654 --> 25:28.570
I don't think hard style
is your thing.

25:29.571 --> 25:30.746
Oh.

25:33.140 --> 25:35.751
Po, why are you
really out here?

25:37.144 --> 25:40.451
I just found out that
my dad... isn't really my dad.

25:42.584 --> 25:44.325
Your dad? The goose.

25:46.980 --> 25:49.243
That must have been
quite a shock.

25:49.417 --> 25:51.332
Yeah.

25:51.506 --> 25:54.335
- And this bothers you?
- Are you kidding me?

25:54.509 --> 25:57.512
We're warriors, right?
Nerves of steel.

25:57.686 --> 25:59.601
Souls of platinum.

25:59.775 --> 26:01.037
Like you.

26:01.211 --> 26:02.952
So hardcore you
don't feel anything.

26:03.126 --> 26:04.301
[chuckles] Yeargh!

26:04.475 --> 26:07.478
Yo. Wow.

26:07.653 --> 26:09.655
- I was...
- [Mantis] So, what are
you guys talking about?

26:10.612 --> 26:12.396
Nothing. Nothing.

26:12.571 --> 26:14.703
Po's having daddy issues.

26:14.877 --> 26:18.054
I'm so lucky. I don't have
any problems with my dad.

26:18.228 --> 26:20.491
Maybe it's because Mom ate
his head before I was born.

26:20.666 --> 26:23.451
- I don't know.
- Mantis,
this isn't about you.

26:23.625 --> 26:25.714
Po is the one freaking out.

26:25.888 --> 26:28.064
- I'm not freaking out.
- Po.

26:28.238 --> 26:30.414
- I'm freaking in.
- Po!

26:30.589 --> 26:33.243
- What?
- We're here.

26:33.417 --> 26:35.376
Gongmen City.

26:44.298 --> 26:46.300
[growls]

26:51.697 --> 26:54.308
[Shen] My father's throne.

26:54.482 --> 26:57.528
He used to let me play here
beside him,

26:57.703 --> 27:02.142
promising someday
that this throne
would be mine.

27:07.016 --> 27:08.278
A little to the left.

27:08.452 --> 27:10.585
Oh, but it's so heavy, master!

27:10.759 --> 27:14.067
Thirty years I've waited
for this moment.

27:14.241 --> 27:17.723
Everything must be exactly
how I envisioned it.

27:17.897 --> 27:21.465
And I envisioned it
a little to the left.

27:21.640 --> 27:23.859
- [gorillas grunt]
- Perfect!

27:24.033 --> 27:27.167
With the weapon by my si...
A little bit more.

27:29.386 --> 27:31.388
With the weapon
by my side,

27:31.562 --> 27:35.088
all of China
will bow before me.

27:35.262 --> 27:36.959
We move out in three days,

27:37.133 --> 27:40.789
when the moon is full
and the tide is high.

27:40.963 --> 27:42.443
[chuckles]

27:42.617 --> 27:45.576
Now, you old goat,
why don't you tell me my...

27:45.751 --> 27:46.795
Fortune?

27:46.969 --> 27:48.710
F... Future.

27:48.884 --> 27:51.626
I was going to say future.

27:51.800 --> 27:55.369
Look into your bowl
and tell me what glory awaits.

27:57.110 --> 28:01.375
If you continue on your
current path... [gasps]

28:03.029 --> 28:06.902
...you will find yourself...
at the bottom of the stairs.

28:08.382 --> 28:09.557
Oh.

28:09.731 --> 28:11.690
I see...

28:12.255 --> 28:14.214
I see...

28:15.041 --> 28:16.651
I see pain.

28:16.825 --> 28:19.001
- Ow!
- And anger.

28:19.175 --> 28:21.656
How dare you?
That is the finest silk
in the province!

28:21.830 --> 28:25.094
- Followed by denial.
- This is not fortune-telling.

28:25.268 --> 28:28.532
- You're just saying
what's happening...
- Now?

28:28.707 --> 28:32.145
- [sighs]
- The most important
time is now.

28:33.494 --> 28:35.757
But if you really want
to see the future...

28:38.717 --> 28:40.370
Oh, what do you see?

28:46.289 --> 28:47.682
[Soothsayer] A peacock...

28:49.466 --> 28:53.470
...is defeated by a warrior
of black and white.

28:54.863 --> 28:56.691
Nothing has changed.

29:00.956 --> 29:02.349
[Shen chuckles]

29:02.523 --> 29:05.831
That's impossible,
and you know it.

29:06.005 --> 29:09.182
It is not impossible,
and he knows it.

29:09.356 --> 29:12.968
- Who?
- Lord Shen! I saw a panda!

29:13.142 --> 29:15.492
- A panda?
- [grunts]

29:15.666 --> 29:18.365
A kung fu warrior.
It fought like a demon!

29:18.539 --> 29:20.193
Big and furry.

29:20.367 --> 29:23.413
Soft and squishy. Ugh.
Kind of plush and cuddly.

29:23.587 --> 29:27.200
There are no more pandas.

29:27.374 --> 29:30.638
[Soothsayer] Even with
his poor eyesight,
he can see the truth.

29:30.812 --> 29:33.772
Why is it that you cannot?

29:33.946 --> 29:37.863
Find this panda
and bring him to me!

29:38.037 --> 29:39.865
Yes, sir!

29:40.039 --> 29:43.869
One panda lives.
That does not make you right.

29:44.043 --> 29:47.742
You're right.
Being right makes me right.

29:47.916 --> 29:52.007
Then I will kill him
and make you wrong.

29:52.181 --> 29:53.792
[crunch]

29:53.966 --> 29:55.881
Will you stop that!

30:00.668 --> 30:01.756
[Po grunts]

30:01.930 --> 30:04.715
[Po scatting] Oh!

30:08.415 --> 30:11.679
That must be Shen's palace
on the other side of the city.

30:11.853 --> 30:14.377
Great. We'll march into
the tower and proclaim,

30:14.551 --> 30:16.771
"We are the Dragon Warrior
and the Furious Five,

30:16.945 --> 30:18.686
and we are here to
bring you to justice!"

30:19.513 --> 30:21.820
[grunting]

30:21.994 --> 30:23.082
What are you doing?

30:23.256 --> 30:24.823
This place is
crawling with wolves.

30:26.607 --> 30:30.263
[chatter]

30:30.437 --> 30:32.831
Hey, isn't that the guy
who hammered you in the face?

30:35.050 --> 30:36.225
Oh!

30:36.399 --> 30:38.053
I do not like that guy.

30:38.227 --> 30:40.316
We need to get to that tower
without being spotted

30:40.490 --> 30:41.578
by those wolves.

30:41.752 --> 30:44.364
Got it. Stealth mode.

30:55.766 --> 30:57.551
- Ow!
- [clattering]

31:03.731 --> 31:07.300
- [snickers]
- [chatter continues]

31:07.474 --> 31:10.042
- [Wolf] Ah, get out
of the way!
- [Po] Foiled again.

31:11.521 --> 31:13.480
Hmm. Where did those
noodles go?

31:14.742 --> 31:15.874
Ooh.

31:18.441 --> 31:20.052
Oh! [giggles]

31:20.226 --> 31:22.793
[girlish voice] Hello.
I couldn't help but...

31:22.968 --> 31:26.145
Yeah, OK.
Anyway, where was I?

31:26.319 --> 31:29.061
- Where's Po?
- How can we lose
a guy that big?

31:31.324 --> 31:33.892
Ooh. OK.

31:35.371 --> 31:36.503
[screams]

31:36.677 --> 31:38.635
[fireworks fizz and whistle]

31:40.115 --> 31:41.943
Guys! Guys?

31:42.117 --> 31:43.814
- Hey, Po.
- What? Sorry.

31:43.989 --> 31:45.468
So that was stealth mode, huh?

31:45.642 --> 31:48.123
To be honest,
not one of my stronger modes.

31:48.297 --> 31:50.560
...gold in there, come on!

31:50.734 --> 31:53.302
- [gasps]
- [Wolf] This rice is raw!

31:53.476 --> 31:56.044
You stole all my metal pots
for Lord Shen!

31:56.218 --> 31:59.830
- Either you cook my rice,
or I cook you!
- My apologies.

32:00.005 --> 32:02.094
Po, do something.

32:02.268 --> 32:05.010
How am I supposed to help her
cook rice without getting
caught?

32:05.184 --> 32:07.142
- Wait, I have a better idea.
- [Wolf] ...two...

32:07.316 --> 32:08.317
One.

32:08.491 --> 32:10.276
- Hey.
- Hey.

32:12.495 --> 32:15.411
[Wolf] Ooh! Aargh! [groans]

32:15.585 --> 32:17.413
- Aaargh!
- [blows thud]

32:17.587 --> 32:19.589
Ooh. Ah.

32:20.155 --> 32:21.983
Yuck!

32:22.157 --> 32:24.203
We're here to liberate
the city and bring Shen
to justice.

32:24.377 --> 32:26.248
- You will need help.
- Thank you, brave sheep,

32:26.422 --> 32:27.510
but it's too dangerous.
I can't let you.

32:27.684 --> 32:29.512
Oh, no, not me.

32:29.686 --> 32:30.861
It's not safe to speak here.

32:31.036 --> 32:32.341
Right.

32:32.515 --> 32:33.386
Ooh.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.953
[screams]

32:35.127 --> 32:37.433
I'm talking about Masters Ox
and Croc.

32:37.607 --> 32:40.480
They're in Gongmen Jail
on Black Dragon Alley.

32:40.654 --> 32:42.786
What? They're still alive?

32:42.961 --> 32:44.919
They must be in that jail
gathering intelligence,

32:45.093 --> 32:47.835
hatching a plot
to use their awesomeness
to defeat the weapon!

32:48.009 --> 32:50.316
OK, let's go!
Thanks, sheep.

32:51.186 --> 32:52.883
Hey! Stop that costume!

32:53.058 --> 32:54.842
- Hold it right there!
- Get them!

32:55.016 --> 32:57.453
- Get them!
- Ooh, sorry!

32:57.627 --> 32:59.107
Take... that!

32:59.281 --> 33:00.848
- Keep going!
- Faster!

33:01.675 --> 33:02.893
Hey!

33:06.549 --> 33:08.508
[wolf soldiers cry out]

33:13.469 --> 33:14.993
Ha-ha.

33:23.088 --> 33:25.133
[shouting]

33:25.307 --> 33:26.308
Surround him.

33:28.789 --> 33:30.312
- [Wolf Leader] Now!
- [Others] Yeargh!

33:30.486 --> 33:32.053
Gotcha!

33:32.227 --> 33:33.098
Huh?

33:33.272 --> 33:34.273
Huh? Where'd he go?

33:34.447 --> 33:36.405
Spread out!
Search everywhere!

33:36.579 --> 33:38.059
[Wolf] What about over there?

33:38.233 --> 33:40.018
[Wolf Leader] Is there
a part of everywhere?

33:40.192 --> 33:43.412
- I... I guess.
- Then search there!

33:48.287 --> 33:51.638
They must be close.
I can feel a kung fu chill
riding up my spine.

33:51.812 --> 33:53.770
Sorry, Po. It's just me.

33:54.945 --> 33:56.947
Look. Gongmen Jail.

34:00.690 --> 34:02.344
Aw, it's cute.

34:03.476 --> 34:06.914
Cute, huh? [shouting]

34:08.611 --> 34:10.570
- Yah!
- Pi-yah!

34:13.486 --> 34:15.618
- Ohh!
- Nice work, Po.

34:17.229 --> 34:19.579
At the first sign of trouble,
I'll give you a signal.

34:19.753 --> 34:21.189
Ga-gah, gi-gee!

34:21.363 --> 34:23.148
- You mean like Crane does?
- Yeah.

34:23.322 --> 34:25.672
Excuse me, when have I
ever made that noise?

34:25.846 --> 34:28.762
Master Ox! Master!

34:30.329 --> 34:33.245
[gasps]
The ferocious Master Croc!

34:34.463 --> 34:37.814
And Master Storming Ox.
[chuckles]

34:37.988 --> 34:40.730
I can't believe we're rescuing
actual legends of kung fu.

34:40.904 --> 34:43.168
We're gonna free you
from those bonds of injustice.
No problem.

34:43.342 --> 34:45.300
Gotta be a key around here.
No, they wouldn't
leave a key around here.

34:45.474 --> 34:46.954
Yah!

34:47.128 --> 34:49.957
Oh, good! You found it.
Come on, you guys! Yeah!

34:50.131 --> 34:53.482
We're coming for you, Shen!
Wah-how!

34:53.656 --> 34:55.702
Wah-hah-hoo-hoo!

34:55.876 --> 34:57.486
Whoo...

34:57.660 --> 34:59.184
Guys, are we going or not?

34:59.358 --> 35:00.837
Do you want to
meet us there later?

35:01.011 --> 35:02.752
You do want to take
back your city, right?

35:02.926 --> 35:04.624
Of course we do.

35:04.798 --> 35:06.147
But if we stand up to Shen,

35:06.321 --> 35:08.845
he will turn the weapon
on the city.

35:09.019 --> 35:12.197
Listen to yourself. You're
protecting Gongmen City by
not protecting Gongmen City?

35:12.371 --> 35:17.376
- If we all fight together...
- Then the weapon would kill
everyone.

35:17.550 --> 35:21.249
Oh, would it?
Then we use... a sneak attack!

35:21.423 --> 35:23.991
- We get inside and then...
- And then you will be
stopped...

35:27.516 --> 35:28.735
...by the unstoppable weapon.

35:28.909 --> 35:30.867
Nothing's unstoppable
except for me

35:31.041 --> 35:33.870
when I'm stopping you from
telling me something's
unstoppable!

35:44.446 --> 35:47.188
Master Ox, I'm not letting you
stay in this cell.

35:47.362 --> 35:49.016
I'd like to see
you get me out!

35:49.190 --> 35:50.148
Hah!

35:54.761 --> 35:57.242
You guys see that?
It's called being awesome.

35:57.416 --> 35:59.157
Come on! Whatever
happened to being heroes?

35:59.331 --> 36:01.898
The only hero in this town
is a dead one!

36:02.072 --> 36:03.422
Aaargh!

36:06.686 --> 36:09.776
Like I said, you are not
getting me out of this cell!

36:11.430 --> 36:12.866
[Master Ox] Oh...

36:13.040 --> 36:14.911
Yes! Ha-ha! Whoo!

36:15.085 --> 36:17.044
All right, let's go!

36:17.914 --> 36:19.089
I get the top bunk.

36:21.309 --> 36:22.963
It's time to surrender, panda.

36:23.137 --> 36:25.444
Kung fu is dead.

36:25.618 --> 36:27.576
I... Ooh...

36:30.231 --> 36:31.363
[stammers] You, you...

36:31.537 --> 36:34.540
Kung fu is dead? Fine!

36:34.714 --> 36:38.326
You stay in your prison
of fear with bars made
of hopelessness.

36:38.500 --> 36:41.721
And all you get are three
square meals a day of shame!

36:41.895 --> 36:43.462
With despair for dessert.

36:43.636 --> 36:45.159
We'll take on Shen

36:45.333 --> 36:47.727
and prove to all those
who are hungry for justice

36:47.901 --> 36:48.858
and honor

36:49.032 --> 36:50.904
that kung fu still lives!

36:51.078 --> 36:52.384
Yeah!

36:53.907 --> 36:55.430
[growling]

36:55.604 --> 36:56.605
Monkey!

36:57.258 --> 36:58.172
Ka-kaaa!

36:58.346 --> 36:59.608
You! You're mine!

36:59.782 --> 37:01.610
I'll tell you
what's gonna be yours!

37:01.784 --> 37:04.483
My fist in your plush,
cuddly, super-soft face!

37:04.657 --> 37:05.614
[both] Yah-ho!

37:05.788 --> 37:07.268
Uh-oh.

37:07.442 --> 37:09.227
Get him!

37:09.401 --> 37:11.794
- Get me out of here!
- Yes, sir!

37:11.968 --> 37:13.231
[Mantis] Stop him! Ya!

37:16.277 --> 37:17.583
Faster!

37:21.630 --> 37:23.066
Go, go!

37:23.241 --> 37:25.852
- Lose him!
- Yes, sir!

37:27.854 --> 37:29.725
- Viper!
- Hang on!

37:29.899 --> 37:31.379
Oooh-waaah!

37:31.553 --> 37:33.555
Whoo-hah!

37:36.950 --> 37:38.604
[whimpering]

37:38.778 --> 37:39.909
What?

37:40.083 --> 37:41.824
Watch out!

37:41.998 --> 37:44.610
Whoa! Waargh!

37:44.784 --> 37:46.525
Uncool, very uncool!

37:46.699 --> 37:49.136
Ah! Try this! [laughs]

37:50.137 --> 37:52.139
Guys, guys, guys!

37:55.011 --> 37:56.317
Ha-ha-ha!

37:56.491 --> 37:58.014
Maybe something smaller!

37:58.188 --> 38:00.626
No, no! Oh, no, no.

38:00.800 --> 38:02.497
[bunnies laugh]

38:02.671 --> 38:05.152
Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha, ha!

38:05.326 --> 38:07.981
Cute bunnies off the face!
Excuse me! OK, pardon me!

38:11.158 --> 38:13.203
Aaaargh!

38:17.686 --> 38:19.253
[Bunnies] Fire! Fire!

38:19.427 --> 38:20.820
We've lost them.

38:20.994 --> 38:23.649
Ah!

38:25.346 --> 38:27.348
[Bunnies] Whoa!

38:30.569 --> 38:31.700
[Bunnies] Again, again!

38:31.874 --> 38:33.528
Hah!

38:33.702 --> 38:35.530
Crane, catch!

38:36.879 --> 38:38.228
Wheee!

38:38.403 --> 38:40.013
- Gotcha!
- Yay!

38:40.187 --> 38:42.885
Whoa! Ow!

38:47.586 --> 38:48.674
Ha-ha!

38:48.848 --> 38:50.676
Guys, guys, guys,
give me a shove!

38:51.503 --> 38:53.418
Mantis, now!

38:56.159 --> 38:58.074
[Tigress] Heh-yah!

39:01.251 --> 39:02.818
[howling]

39:03.732 --> 39:06.735
[cries out]

39:06.909 --> 39:08.607
Is that all you've got?
'Cause it feels like

39:08.781 --> 39:10.783
I'm fighting a big,
old, fluffy cloud!

39:10.957 --> 39:12.959
Well, this cloud is
about to bring the thunder!

39:13.133 --> 39:15.527
- [clanging]
- Ooh! Ow! Ow!

39:16.571 --> 39:18.617
- Your turn!
- Huh? Ah! Ooh!

39:18.791 --> 39:20.532
Ha-ha-ha!

39:20.706 --> 39:22.621
- Why are there...
so many signs?
- [clanging]

39:22.795 --> 39:23.752
[howls]

39:29.584 --> 39:32.413
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

39:34.241 --> 39:36.243
[both cry out]

39:38.941 --> 39:41.248
Come here!
Alakasquasho!

39:42.597 --> 39:45.948
Yes! Taste the defeat!

39:46.122 --> 39:48.124
Let me tell you something.

39:48.298 --> 39:50.475
Next time you mess with
a panda, you better
bring a whole...

39:50.649 --> 39:52.390
[snarling]

40:00.789 --> 40:03.966
I guess nobody told you,
if you mess with the wolf,

40:04.140 --> 40:05.185
you get the fangs.

40:05.359 --> 40:07.405
- Ooh!
- I've hit you twice.

40:07.579 --> 40:09.755
What are you going to do now?

40:12.627 --> 40:14.455
We surrender!

40:14.629 --> 40:15.587
Ha!

40:18.198 --> 40:21.114
You can chain my body,
but you'll never chain my...

40:21.288 --> 40:22.637
...warrior spirit.

40:22.811 --> 40:23.595
Hey, don't forget
the little guy.

40:23.769 --> 40:24.987
Did you just call...?

40:25.161 --> 40:26.989
Po, what are you doing?

40:27.163 --> 40:29.775
Trust me. I got a pl...
Aargh! Ow!

40:29.949 --> 40:32.865
No way. Eight-point
acupressure cuffs?

40:33.039 --> 40:34.606
Just like the ones
that held Tai Lung.

40:34.780 --> 40:37.043
The more you move,
the tighter they get. [howls]

40:37.217 --> 40:39.175
These are the best cuffs!
[grunts]

40:41.700 --> 40:44.354
Greetings, panda.
At last we meet!

40:45.791 --> 40:47.575
No, no.
No, no, no.

40:50.883 --> 40:54.495
We meet at last!
Yes, that's it.

40:54.669 --> 40:56.323
Greetings, panda.

40:56.497 --> 40:58.978
We meet at... [gasps]

40:59.152 --> 41:02.851
- You are afraid for a reason.
- I am not afraid.

41:03.025 --> 41:05.811
He is coming to me in chains.

41:05.985 --> 41:08.422
- If anyone should
be afraid, it's...
- You.

41:11.686 --> 41:14.167
Don't even think about it.

41:27.310 --> 41:30.226
I hope this turns out
better than your plan
to cook rice in your stomach,

41:30.400 --> 41:32.707
by eating it raw
and then
drinking boiling water.

41:32.881 --> 41:34.883
This plan is
nothing like that plan.

41:35.057 --> 41:37.016
- How?
- This one's going to work.

41:48.201 --> 41:49.463
[chuckles]

41:49.637 --> 41:51.596
Keep moving.

41:57.384 --> 41:59.865
Ah, my old enemy.

42:04.609 --> 42:06.262
Stairs.

42:06.436 --> 42:08.438
[thudding steps]

42:10.266 --> 42:13.705
- [thudding]
- [grunting]

42:27.022 --> 42:28.981
[Po groans]

42:34.813 --> 42:38.120
Thanks for carrying me
those last few flights. OK.

42:38.294 --> 42:40.645
I threw up a little bit
on the third floor.

42:40.819 --> 42:42.298
Someone might
want to clean that up.

42:42.472 --> 42:44.997
Is there some sort of
evil janitor or something?

42:45.171 --> 42:46.781
Greetings, panda.

42:46.955 --> 42:49.262
- We meet at...
- Hey, how you doing?

42:50.959 --> 42:52.439
Hey.

42:52.613 --> 42:55.485
You've grown up
bigger than I thought.

42:55.660 --> 42:58.445
Hey. Enough with
the poking around.

42:58.619 --> 43:01.448
Strong, hmm? Healthy.

43:01.622 --> 43:04.190
Look, I don't know
who you are,
but please stand aside, sir.

43:04.364 --> 43:06.801
- [whispers] That's a lady.
- Oh! Sorry.

43:06.975 --> 43:09.761
The beard threw me.
It's kind of misleading.

43:09.935 --> 43:12.981
- False advertising.
- Enough of this nonsense!

43:13.155 --> 43:14.809
Bring the prisoners to me.

43:14.983 --> 43:16.637
Sorry, ma'am.
Get ready, guys.

43:16.811 --> 43:19.292
Keep your eyes peeled
for the... weapon!

43:20.206 --> 43:22.164
Yeargh! Hah! Yah!

43:23.862 --> 43:26.081
Sparrow kick! Wyy-yah!

43:26.255 --> 43:28.127
We did it!
I just kung fu-ed it!

43:28.301 --> 43:30.129
Did you guys see that?
I was all like...

43:30.303 --> 43:32.305
Waaargh...!

43:33.654 --> 43:34.699
Oh!

43:35.830 --> 43:39.051
[Shen laughs]

43:39.225 --> 43:42.576
Do you actually believe
this is the warrior
destined to defeat me?

43:42.750 --> 43:45.797
I do not.
I know he is.

43:45.971 --> 43:48.234
[laughs] Oh, look at him.

43:48.408 --> 43:52.238
A lifetime to plot his revenge
and he comes to me
on his knees.

43:52.412 --> 43:54.370
What? A lifetime?
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

43:54.544 --> 43:56.155
I did not have a lifetime.

43:56.329 --> 43:57.983
We only heard about
Master Rhino a few days ago,

43:58.157 --> 43:59.419
and we came
to avenge him!

43:59.593 --> 44:02.814
You've come to avenge
nothing else?

44:02.988 --> 44:05.425
Well, yeah. All the pots
and pans that you stole.

44:05.599 --> 44:08.080
- I'm gonna want those back.
- Nothing else?

44:08.254 --> 44:10.952
You probably did some other
evil stuff along the way,
I don't know.

44:11.126 --> 44:12.954
- What else did you do?
- You don't know?

44:13.128 --> 44:14.347
- Know what?
- [laughter]

44:14.521 --> 44:16.088
What's so funny?

44:16.262 --> 44:18.830
The very thing that
you clearly do not know!

44:19.004 --> 44:22.921
OK, enough of these riddles!
Would you guys
spill the beans?

44:23.095 --> 44:26.402
First we come in
and the weapon is tiny.
Surprise, it's big.

44:26.576 --> 44:28.883
Then the lady over here,
I think it's a guy.

44:29.057 --> 44:30.711
'Cause he's got... Whoa!

44:30.885 --> 44:33.627
The only reason
you are still alive

44:33.801 --> 44:38.458
is that I find your stupidity
mildly amusing.

44:38.632 --> 44:41.896
Well, thank you.
But I find your evilness
extremely annoying.

44:42.070 --> 44:43.898
Who do you think you are,
panda?

44:44.072 --> 44:46.684
Who do you think I am,
peacock?

44:46.858 --> 44:48.990
[both laugh]

44:55.736 --> 44:58.391
Why are we laughing?
[sighs]

44:58.565 --> 44:59.697
Take aim.

45:11.273 --> 45:13.711
Fire. [laughs]

45:15.930 --> 45:16.844
Huh?

45:17.018 --> 45:19.760
Well, light the thing!

45:19.934 --> 45:21.893
I did!

45:26.288 --> 45:28.247
Fear the bug!

45:31.424 --> 45:32.425
Ha-ha!

45:37.125 --> 45:38.605
[Po] Get the weapon!

45:40.650 --> 45:42.652
Tigress!

45:50.791 --> 45:52.314
[screams]

45:55.753 --> 45:57.885
[continues screaming]

45:59.669 --> 46:01.019
[cheering]

46:06.198 --> 46:08.156
[crying]

46:15.337 --> 46:16.817
You... you were there.

46:16.991 --> 46:19.820
Yes. Yes, I was.

46:28.002 --> 46:29.264
You just let Shen get away!

46:29.438 --> 46:30.875
At least we destroyed
the weapon.

46:35.401 --> 46:37.403
Fire!

46:39.927 --> 46:41.711
Oh, no, he's got way more.

46:44.062 --> 46:45.150
Aargh, aargh!

46:48.066 --> 46:49.894
- My wing!
- Help, Po!

46:50.068 --> 46:51.721
Coming! Aaargh!

46:51.896 --> 46:53.593
- Watch out!
- Po!

46:55.508 --> 46:57.510
Whoa. Wow!

46:57.684 --> 47:00.513
- Help me up!
- No. Get him down.

47:00.687 --> 47:02.167
Use the ropes.

47:05.083 --> 47:07.041
Waaargh!

47:11.132 --> 47:13.178
Run, run, little panda!

47:15.484 --> 47:17.399
Whoa! [screams]

47:17.573 --> 47:18.531
[screeches]

47:22.317 --> 47:24.276
[panting]

47:24.450 --> 47:26.495
Po, come on.
We need you to focus!

47:26.669 --> 47:29.237
- I got it, I got it!
- Bring it down!

47:32.806 --> 47:34.764
- We're trapped!
- This way!

47:35.809 --> 47:37.811
[rumbling]

47:37.985 --> 47:40.901
[laughing] Goodbye!

47:41.946 --> 47:43.034
Yah!

47:43.991 --> 47:45.297
Fire!

47:46.776 --> 47:49.083
Get back!

47:49.257 --> 47:51.085
Hah! Hah!

47:56.264 --> 47:58.832
- The only way out is up.
- Aaargh!

47:59.006 --> 48:01.008
[all] What? [screaming]

48:07.101 --> 48:09.060
Yee-hah!

48:10.452 --> 48:11.453
Whoo-hoo!

48:11.627 --> 48:13.542
Follow me! Come on!

48:14.717 --> 48:16.806
- Where are they going?
- To the top!

48:16.981 --> 48:19.070
Come on! Keep going!

48:26.120 --> 48:27.600
Here we go!

48:31.386 --> 48:33.345
Whoa-aahh!

48:46.314 --> 48:47.663
You idiot!

48:47.837 --> 48:49.883
Ow! My nose!

48:50.057 --> 48:53.843
Call in the wolves!
All of them. I want them ready
to move!

48:54.018 --> 48:57.978
The Year of the Peacock
begins now!

48:58.152 --> 48:59.632
Right now?

48:59.806 --> 49:01.460
'Cause it's the middle
of the year,

49:01.634 --> 49:03.897
so you'd only get,
like, a half of the
Year of the Peacock.

49:05.681 --> 49:09.337
And this is the Year,
of course, of the Peacock.

49:09.511 --> 49:10.948
Happy New Year, sir.

49:14.734 --> 49:19.043
Get the wolves ready.
We're loading the ships now.

49:19.217 --> 49:20.348
Now!

49:20.522 --> 49:22.437
Now, now, now, now!

49:22.611 --> 49:25.310
Move! Move, move, move, move!

49:32.012 --> 49:33.971
[howls]

49:41.804 --> 49:43.763
[Tigress] This way.

49:47.810 --> 49:49.551
- [howling]
- Let's go.

49:51.989 --> 49:54.774
[grunting]

49:54.948 --> 49:58.256
Oh, you! What did you do?
It's chaos up there.

49:58.430 --> 50:00.040
What happened
to stopping Shen?

50:01.563 --> 50:03.348
Yeah.

50:04.610 --> 50:06.786
Guys, come on.
Give me a little credit.

50:06.960 --> 50:09.919
I meant for him to get away
because, uh...

50:10.094 --> 50:12.270
...it was a trick.
It was a plot.

50:12.444 --> 50:17.231
I was thinking...
I'll figure out his plot more.

50:17.971 --> 50:20.017
That makes no sense.

50:20.191 --> 50:23.150
- What do you mean?
Sure it does.
- Po, the truth.

50:23.324 --> 50:25.848
- You had Shen. What happened?
- What are you talking about?

50:26.023 --> 50:28.764
I don't know what
you're talking about. I...
Yeah...

50:28.938 --> 50:30.288
OK, he caught me off guard.

50:31.115 --> 50:33.073
The truth.

50:35.597 --> 50:39.340
Fine. They will keep you
far from danger.

50:39.514 --> 50:42.039
- Real far.
- What?

50:42.213 --> 50:44.258
You're staying here.

50:44.432 --> 50:46.434
W... Wait!

50:46.608 --> 50:48.219
I have to go ba...

50:52.614 --> 50:54.442
You're staying here!

50:54.616 --> 50:57.097
I'm going.
And you can't stop me.

50:57.967 --> 50:59.273
Whoa!

51:00.448 --> 51:02.711
OK. I wasn't ready that time.

51:02.885 --> 51:04.583
Guys? Don't.

51:04.757 --> 51:05.801
Ready.

51:06.454 --> 51:07.499
Look!

51:08.804 --> 51:10.502
[screams]

51:14.114 --> 51:16.073
- Aaaah!
- [thudding]

51:20.077 --> 51:21.426
Stay down.

51:23.123 --> 51:25.604
- I have to get to him.
- Then tell me why!

51:28.563 --> 51:30.913
He was there! OK?

51:31.088 --> 51:34.265
The peacock was there
the last time
I saw my parents.

51:34.439 --> 51:38.051
He knows what happened.
Where I came from.

51:38.225 --> 51:40.619
Who I am.

51:44.318 --> 51:46.277
Look, I'm going.

51:46.973 --> 51:49.454
I have to know.

51:49.628 --> 51:52.457
- The hardcore
can't understand.
- Tigress, no!

51:57.679 --> 51:59.638
The hardcore do understand.

52:01.379 --> 52:05.252
But I can't watch
my friend be killed.

52:05.426 --> 52:09.517
- We're going.
- Maybe you can't
watch me be killed?

52:09.691 --> 52:12.564
- Stop being a wimp.
- And she's back.

52:14.261 --> 52:16.394
- No.
- Don't worry, kid.

52:16.568 --> 52:18.309
You're better off here.

52:27.970 --> 52:30.059
[Shen] You were wrong,
Soothsayer.

52:30.234 --> 52:33.150
We sail to victory tonight.

52:33.324 --> 52:35.630
Your magic panda
is clearly a fool.

52:35.804 --> 52:38.720
Are you certain
it is the panda who is a fool?

52:38.894 --> 52:41.332
You just destroyed
your ancestral home, Shen.

52:41.506 --> 52:46.815
A trivial sacrifice
when all of China
is my reward.

52:46.989 --> 52:49.383
Then will you finally
be satisfied?

52:49.557 --> 52:51.646
Will the subjugation
of the whole world

52:51.820 --> 52:53.779
finally make you
feel better?

52:53.953 --> 52:55.563
Mmm, it's a start.

52:55.737 --> 52:58.305
I might also convert
the basement into a dungeon.

53:01.265 --> 53:04.006
The cup you choose to fill
has no bottom.

53:04.181 --> 53:07.096
It is time to stop
this madness.

53:08.228 --> 53:10.099
Why on earth
would I do that?

53:10.274 --> 53:13.146
So your parents
can rest in peace.

53:13.320 --> 53:16.193
My parents hated me.

53:17.498 --> 53:19.065
Do you understand?

53:20.545 --> 53:22.721
They wronged me.

53:22.895 --> 53:25.898
And... I will make it right.

53:26.072 --> 53:27.334
They loved you.

53:27.508 --> 53:29.031
They loved you so much

53:29.206 --> 53:32.209
that having to send you
away killed them.

53:34.907 --> 53:37.344
The dead exist in the past...

53:38.389 --> 53:40.652
...and I must tend
to the future.

53:45.526 --> 53:49.574
Set the Soothsayer free.
She's no use to me.

53:49.748 --> 53:51.315
Goodbye, Shen.

53:51.489 --> 53:53.360
I wish you happiness.

53:53.534 --> 53:56.233
Happiness must be taken...

53:57.886 --> 54:00.193
...and I will take mine.

54:13.946 --> 54:14.990
Huh?

54:21.780 --> 54:23.260
[Wolf Soldier] Hurry it up!

54:26.001 --> 54:27.916
If all of those weapons
leave the building,

54:28.090 --> 54:29.527
China will fall.

54:29.701 --> 54:32.007
- We bring down the building!
- Hey, guys.

54:32.181 --> 54:33.574
How about this?

54:35.010 --> 54:37.056
Oh! This will work!

54:37.230 --> 54:40.015
- All right, let's go.
- I can't feel my face.

54:44.803 --> 54:45.804
[gasps]

54:47.501 --> 54:48.589
Aargh!

54:48.763 --> 54:50.287
[groaning]

54:55.727 --> 54:57.990
[mumbling] Did you hear him
call it Year of the Peacock?

54:58.164 --> 54:59.818
- [scoffs]
- Hey.

54:59.992 --> 55:01.036
Hey.

55:01.210 --> 55:02.603
OK. Keep it cool.
Keep it cool.

55:02.777 --> 55:05.171
[Guard] You!
Where are you going?

55:07.304 --> 55:08.740
On your feet!

55:08.914 --> 55:10.742
And wipe those stupid grins
off your faces.

55:19.228 --> 55:21.579
[wolf howling]

55:24.190 --> 55:25.365
[Shen] Move, you dogs!

55:25.539 --> 55:27.933
Faster, faster.
Load them all.

55:36.898 --> 55:38.073
[Shen laughs]

55:38.247 --> 55:40.293
Greetings, panda.

55:40.989 --> 55:42.208
[gasps]

55:43.905 --> 55:45.385
Tell me what happened
that night.

55:45.559 --> 55:46.908
What night?

55:47.082 --> 55:50.085
- That night.
- Ah, that night.

55:50.259 --> 55:53.175
Yes. We're talking
about the same night, right?

55:53.350 --> 55:55.613
Yes, I was there.

55:55.787 --> 55:57.919
Yes. I watched
as your parents abandoned you.

55:58.093 --> 55:59.660
It's a terrible thing.

55:59.834 --> 56:01.880
I believe it went
something like this.

56:03.055 --> 56:04.056
Waah!

56:05.666 --> 56:08.016
Aaaah!

56:11.455 --> 56:12.673
[grunts]

56:12.847 --> 56:14.371
Here's your New Year's gift.

56:14.545 --> 56:16.590
Hope you like it
'cause you can't return it.

56:16.764 --> 56:18.331
- [chuckles]
- [Po] Aargh!

56:18.505 --> 56:20.855
Po? What's he doing here?

56:21.856 --> 56:23.031
Return it! Return it!

56:28.167 --> 56:29.734
Yah! Hah!

56:31.605 --> 56:33.390
[shrieks]

56:35.174 --> 56:37.655
[chuckling] Are you willing
to die to find the truth?

56:37.829 --> 56:39.221
You bet I am.

56:39.396 --> 56:41.354
Although I'd prefer not to.

56:41.528 --> 56:42.703
Yow!

56:45.010 --> 56:46.794
Waargh!

56:47.578 --> 56:48.666
[grunts]

56:51.625 --> 56:52.931
[groans]

56:57.762 --> 56:59.285
[grunting]

57:04.159 --> 57:05.596
[Mantis] We got them. Go!

57:05.770 --> 57:06.727
Wah!

57:07.424 --> 57:08.642
Yah!

57:08.816 --> 57:09.991
- [roars]
- [snarls]

57:10.644 --> 57:11.993
[Tigress grunts]

57:13.517 --> 57:14.953
Whoa! Oh!

57:20.088 --> 57:23.657
[screaming]

57:27.705 --> 57:29.097
[Po] You looking for me?

57:34.538 --> 57:35.974
Um...

57:36.148 --> 57:37.628
I said that too soon,
didn't I?

57:37.802 --> 57:40.239
Kee-ya! Ahhh!

57:46.332 --> 57:47.333
Po!

57:52.294 --> 57:53.818
Po, get away from him.

57:53.992 --> 57:55.907
I'll get up.
Here we go.

57:58.736 --> 57:59.824
No more running, Shen.

57:59.998 --> 58:01.390
So it seems.

58:01.565 --> 58:03.567
Now... answers.

58:03.741 --> 58:05.438
Oh, you want to know so badly.

58:05.612 --> 58:06.918
[breathing heavily]

58:07.092 --> 58:10.356
You think knowing
will heal you, huh?

58:10.530 --> 58:14.621
Fill some crater
in your soul?

58:14.795 --> 58:16.884
Well, here's your answer.

58:17.058 --> 58:20.061
Your parents
didn't love you.

58:21.149 --> 58:23.064
But here,

58:23.238 --> 58:25.763
let me heal you!

58:25.937 --> 58:26.894
[gasps]

58:30.071 --> 58:31.029
[metallic snarl]

58:31.638 --> 58:33.248
- Ah!
- No!

58:40.081 --> 58:41.039
Oh!

58:47.611 --> 58:50.178
[thunderclap]

59:10.938 --> 59:12.810
[thuds]

59:21.558 --> 59:24.909
[thunder rumbling]

59:45.320 --> 59:48.106
[gasps] Ohh!

59:48.280 --> 59:50.499
Yeah, like you could
make me drink that.

59:50.674 --> 59:52.458
Aaahh! Aaah...

59:53.502 --> 59:54.808
[groans]

59:54.982 --> 59:56.854
If I wanted you dead,

59:57.028 --> 59:59.247
I would have left you
in that river.

59:59.421 --> 01:00:00.684
Well, why save me?

01:00:00.858 --> 01:00:03.382
So you can fulfill
your destiny.

01:00:03.556 --> 01:00:06.733
What are you talking about?
Where am I?

01:00:09.040 --> 01:00:11.129
[Po] What is this place?

01:00:11.303 --> 01:00:14.828
I'm surprised you
remember so little.

01:00:15.002 --> 01:00:18.353
But you were so little
when it happened.

01:00:18.527 --> 01:00:20.791
- [muffled uproar]
- Aah!

01:00:23.663 --> 01:00:26.144
Perhaps you do remember.

01:00:26.318 --> 01:00:28.407
What? It's just
a stupid nightmare.

01:00:28.581 --> 01:00:30.627
Nightmare or memory?

01:00:36.284 --> 01:00:37.677
[gurgling]

01:00:55.913 --> 01:00:57.349
[laughter]

01:01:01.658 --> 01:01:04.225
This was a thriving village.

01:01:04.399 --> 01:01:07.925
Young Shen was in line
to rule Gongmen City.

01:01:08.099 --> 01:01:09.970
But he wanted more.

01:01:10.144 --> 01:01:14.322
I foretold that someone
would stand in his way.

01:01:14.496 --> 01:01:16.107
A panda.

01:01:16.281 --> 01:01:19.893
But I never could have
foretold what came next.

01:01:20.067 --> 01:01:21.939
[baby crying]

01:01:23.723 --> 01:01:25.246
[cries out]

01:01:29.076 --> 01:01:30.991
[whimpers]

01:01:33.211 --> 01:01:34.560
Get them all!

01:01:41.393 --> 01:01:43.395
Take our son and run away.

01:01:43.569 --> 01:01:44.613
Go!

01:01:53.927 --> 01:01:55.015
[crying]

01:01:55.189 --> 01:01:57.496
[gasps]

01:01:58.279 --> 01:02:00.281
Stop fighting.

01:02:00.455 --> 01:02:01.761
Let it flow.

01:02:46.980 --> 01:02:48.199
[gasping]

01:02:52.246 --> 01:02:53.421
[snarling]

01:03:01.690 --> 01:03:03.736
[gurgles and mews]

01:03:06.130 --> 01:03:08.088
[crying]

01:03:09.350 --> 01:03:11.700
Shh. Shh!

01:03:14.486 --> 01:03:16.009
Mmm-ma.

01:03:20.840 --> 01:03:22.494
[gurgling]

01:03:27.020 --> 01:03:28.805
[crying]

01:03:35.376 --> 01:03:37.422
[snarling]

01:03:38.510 --> 01:03:40.860
[wailing]

01:03:47.301 --> 01:03:49.390
[sighs heavily]

01:04:05.754 --> 01:04:09.889
Your story may not have
such a happy beginning

01:04:10.063 --> 01:04:13.110
but that doesn't
make you who you are.

01:04:13.284 --> 01:04:15.808
It is the rest of your story.

01:04:16.722 --> 01:04:18.855
Who you choose to be.

01:04:51.017 --> 01:04:54.368
So, who are you, panda?

01:05:02.594 --> 01:05:04.030
I am Po.

01:05:05.858 --> 01:05:07.773
And I'm gonna need a hat.

01:05:17.261 --> 01:05:20.090
Such sad, sad faces.

01:05:20.264 --> 01:05:23.136
But now is a time
only for joy.

01:05:23.310 --> 01:05:27.271
You are going to be part
of something beautiful.

01:05:27.445 --> 01:05:29.403
[growls]

01:05:29.577 --> 01:05:31.840
Once we reach the harbor,

01:05:32.015 --> 01:05:33.581
in front of all the world,

01:05:33.755 --> 01:05:37.846
you and your precious
kung fu will die.

01:05:38.021 --> 01:05:39.936
[laughs]

01:05:40.110 --> 01:05:44.984
Then China will know
to bow before me.

01:05:45.158 --> 01:05:46.116
Set sail!

01:05:46.290 --> 01:05:47.508
- Aargh!
- [clang]

01:05:48.727 --> 01:05:51.034
[laughter]

01:05:51.208 --> 01:05:52.861
[all gasp]

01:05:58.041 --> 01:05:59.477
What is that?

01:06:20.019 --> 01:06:23.196
Honestly, guys,
I never thought
I'd die like this.

01:06:23.370 --> 01:06:26.330
I always thought I'd meet
a nice girl and settle down

01:06:26.504 --> 01:06:28.201
and then she'd eat my head.

01:06:28.375 --> 01:06:30.856
- So sad.
- We cannot give up hope.

01:06:31.030 --> 01:06:32.553
Po would want us
to remain strong.

01:06:32.727 --> 01:06:35.513
Hardcore.
Right, Tigress?

01:06:43.521 --> 01:06:45.175
Lord Shen,
what about the bridge?

01:06:45.349 --> 01:06:47.394
Nothing stands in my way.

01:06:48.221 --> 01:06:49.353
[Shen] Fire!

01:06:55.620 --> 01:06:57.013
[shouts of panic]

01:06:58.753 --> 01:07:00.451
You coward!

01:07:10.069 --> 01:07:11.027
Po?

01:07:13.899 --> 01:07:14.900
[all] Po!

01:07:16.206 --> 01:07:17.424
Huh?

01:07:17.598 --> 01:07:19.383
How many times
do I have to kill

01:07:19.557 --> 01:07:22.081
the same stinking panda?

01:07:31.743 --> 01:07:33.136
Shen!

01:07:33.310 --> 01:07:35.877
A panda stands
between you and your...

01:07:36.052 --> 01:07:37.357
[distant] ...destiny.

01:07:38.228 --> 01:07:39.185
What?

01:07:39.359 --> 01:07:40.795
Prepare yourself for a hot...

01:07:40.969 --> 01:07:43.320
[distant] ...
serving of justice.

01:07:43.494 --> 01:07:45.148
Your reign of terror
comes to an end.

01:07:45.322 --> 01:07:48.586
- What?
- And now, free the Five!

01:07:48.760 --> 01:07:50.762
Disc of Destruction!

01:07:57.029 --> 01:07:58.944
[Wolf Soldiers grunt]

01:07:59.510 --> 01:08:00.815
[groans]

01:08:01.903 --> 01:08:03.209
OK.

01:08:03.383 --> 01:08:04.776
Take aim!

01:08:16.135 --> 01:08:18.529
- Ready?
- Oh!

01:08:19.269 --> 01:08:20.139
[grunts]

01:08:20.313 --> 01:08:22.098
Ohh! Aargh! Ow!

01:08:23.795 --> 01:08:25.144
[grunts]

01:08:26.406 --> 01:08:28.016
Oh, ho, ho, ho!

01:08:30.149 --> 01:08:32.891
[grunting]

01:08:33.065 --> 01:08:35.502
This way and that way.
That way and this way.

01:08:38.636 --> 01:08:39.898
You can't follow me.

01:08:40.855 --> 01:08:41.900
Just get him!

01:08:42.814 --> 01:08:45.033
[chuckles nervously]

01:08:45.991 --> 01:08:47.123
Oh!

01:08:47.297 --> 01:08:48.950
- Yeah, huh. Here we go.
- Come on!

01:08:49.864 --> 01:08:51.214
[gasps]

01:08:52.737 --> 01:08:53.868
Ya-ha!

01:08:56.219 --> 01:08:57.611
- No, no, no, don't shoot!
- Don't shoot!

01:08:57.785 --> 01:08:59.178
No, don't shoot!

01:08:59.352 --> 01:09:02.138
- Don't shoot.
- Don't shoot!

01:09:02.312 --> 01:09:03.704
I won't shoot
if you won't shoot.

01:09:03.878 --> 01:09:04.879
Don't shoot!

01:09:05.924 --> 01:09:07.360
Woo-woo! Hah!

01:09:07.534 --> 01:09:09.275
Don't shoot! Crossfire!

01:09:09.449 --> 01:09:10.407
Attack!

01:09:12.757 --> 01:09:14.237
Hi-yah! Yah!

01:09:16.587 --> 01:09:17.762
Catch of Freedom!

01:09:17.936 --> 01:09:19.024
Monkey!

01:09:24.464 --> 01:09:26.597
Impressive, Dragon Warrior.
What's your plan?

01:09:26.771 --> 01:09:27.902
Step one: Free the Five.

01:09:28.076 --> 01:09:29.426
What's step two?

01:09:29.600 --> 01:09:31.341
Honestly, I didn't think
I'd make it this far.

01:09:31.515 --> 01:09:34.344
- Po!
- Uh, stop Shen
before he gets to the harbor.

01:09:39.305 --> 01:09:40.959
Woo-hoo! Nice.

01:09:43.570 --> 01:09:44.876
Viper, Puppet of Death!

01:09:45.659 --> 01:09:46.617
Tigress!

01:09:51.012 --> 01:09:52.884
[Master Ox shouts]

01:09:53.058 --> 01:09:53.972
Huh!

01:09:54.146 --> 01:09:56.366
[gasps] Master Ox!

01:09:56.540 --> 01:09:58.542
- Cham-pah!
- [Po] And Croc!

01:09:58.716 --> 01:10:00.021
Vengeance is served.

01:10:00.196 --> 01:10:01.588
- Why did you...?
- Your friend there

01:10:01.762 --> 01:10:02.937
is very persuasive.

01:10:06.941 --> 01:10:08.247
Hi-yah!

01:10:08.421 --> 01:10:09.857
Yoo-ha! Wah!

01:10:10.684 --> 01:10:11.816
Master Shifu!

01:10:14.166 --> 01:10:16.473
Quickly. Use their boats
to block the way.

01:10:24.785 --> 01:10:27.135
Aah! Aah! Aah!

01:10:27.310 --> 01:10:28.224
Crane!

01:10:29.268 --> 01:10:32.663
Wings of Justice!
Ka-kaaa!

01:10:32.837 --> 01:10:34.447
Woo-hoo-hoo! Yeah!

01:10:35.535 --> 01:10:36.623
Yee-haw!

01:10:40.714 --> 01:10:41.672
What?

01:10:51.725 --> 01:10:55.338
[slow motion] I love you guys.

01:11:04.782 --> 01:11:06.784
Why aren't we firing?

01:11:06.958 --> 01:11:09.700
They're taking out
our gunners, sir.
They're getting close.

01:11:11.267 --> 01:11:14.618
Fire! Fire!
F-F-Fire at them!

01:11:14.792 --> 01:11:16.837
But, sir, we'll kill our own.

01:11:17.011 --> 01:11:18.970
I said, fire at them!

01:11:19.144 --> 01:11:20.145
Fire!

01:11:22.843 --> 01:11:23.801
No.

01:11:24.802 --> 01:11:25.933
[groans]

01:11:31.374 --> 01:11:32.331
Po!

01:11:40.948 --> 01:11:42.472
[coughing]

01:12:08.367 --> 01:12:09.499
Tigress?

01:12:34.437 --> 01:12:35.655
[groans]

01:12:41.008 --> 01:12:42.749
[laughs]

01:12:59.331 --> 01:13:01.028
As you wish.

01:13:01.202 --> 01:13:03.248
Let's finish this.

01:13:26.489 --> 01:13:27.577
Fire!

01:13:32.843 --> 01:13:36.281
[Po] Inner peace.
Inner peace. Inner peace.

01:13:53.907 --> 01:13:55.605
Aaieee!

01:13:55.779 --> 01:13:57.084
Ho, ho, ho!

01:13:57.258 --> 01:13:58.390
Cha, cha, cha!

01:14:02.089 --> 01:14:03.090
Again!

01:14:05.484 --> 01:14:06.964
Whoa, whoa!

01:14:09.227 --> 01:14:10.271
[gasps]

01:14:10.446 --> 01:14:11.795
Yeah! [grunts]

01:14:11.969 --> 01:14:15.668
Kill him! Somebody kill him!

01:14:17.540 --> 01:14:20.020
Aah... oh!

01:14:20.543 --> 01:14:21.500
Ha, ha!

01:14:31.989 --> 01:14:32.946
Yai!

01:14:36.863 --> 01:14:38.778
- [cheering]
- What?

01:14:38.952 --> 01:14:40.258
[Shen] No!

01:14:46.960 --> 01:14:48.353
Keep firing!

01:14:48.527 --> 01:14:49.920
Keep firing!

01:14:57.971 --> 01:14:59.756
Aaahh!

01:15:10.375 --> 01:15:11.376
Skadoosh!

01:15:24.650 --> 01:15:25.651
[coughs]

01:15:42.320 --> 01:15:43.626
How did you...?

01:15:45.105 --> 01:15:46.672
How did you do it?

01:15:50.676 --> 01:15:52.112
You know, you just
keep your elbows up

01:15:52.286 --> 01:15:53.200
and keep the shoulders loose.

01:15:53.374 --> 01:15:54.550
[Shen] Not that.

01:15:54.724 --> 01:15:56.508
How did you find peace?

01:15:56.682 --> 01:15:58.815
I took away your parents.

01:15:58.989 --> 01:16:00.338
Everything.

01:16:00.512 --> 01:16:02.862
I scarred you for life.

01:16:03.036 --> 01:16:05.473
See, that's the thing, Shen.

01:16:05.648 --> 01:16:07.040
Scars heal.

01:16:07.214 --> 01:16:09.303
No, they don't.

01:16:09.477 --> 01:16:11.218
Wounds heal.

01:16:11.392 --> 01:16:13.003
Oh, yeah.
What do scars do?

01:16:13.177 --> 01:16:16.484
- They fade, I guess.
- I don't care what scars do.

01:16:16.659 --> 01:16:18.356
You should, Shen.

01:16:18.530 --> 01:16:20.097
You gotta let go
of that stuff from the past

01:16:20.271 --> 01:16:22.490
'cause it just doesn't matter.

01:16:22.665 --> 01:16:27.104
The only thing that matters
is what you choose to be now.

01:16:27.278 --> 01:16:28.714
You're right.

01:16:28.888 --> 01:16:31.238
Then I choose... this!

01:16:37.114 --> 01:16:38.115
Aargh!

01:16:58.178 --> 01:16:59.223
Whoa!

01:17:00.441 --> 01:17:02.313
Ohh! Aargh!

01:17:08.841 --> 01:17:09.799
[gasps]

01:17:09.973 --> 01:17:12.105
[cheering]

01:17:14.499 --> 01:17:15.500
[sighs]

01:17:24.030 --> 01:17:26.206
That was pretty hardcore.

01:17:35.607 --> 01:17:39.959
- Po, come here! Yeah!
- Don't ever do that
again, please.

01:17:40.133 --> 01:17:43.746
It seems you have
found inner peace.

01:17:43.920 --> 01:17:46.313
And at such a young age.

01:17:46.487 --> 01:17:48.272
Well, I had a
pretty good teacher.

01:17:48.446 --> 01:17:49.490
Oh!

01:17:51.449 --> 01:17:53.190
[fireworks pop and whistle]

01:17:58.499 --> 01:18:00.153
[cheering]

01:18:09.336 --> 01:18:10.816
[female voice] What do you
mean, he's not here?

01:18:10.990 --> 01:18:13.036
It's my son's birthday.

01:18:13.210 --> 01:18:15.560
All he wanted was
to meet the Dragon Warrior.

01:18:15.734 --> 01:18:17.954
How about some tofu
birthday cake instead, huh?

01:18:18.128 --> 01:18:21.435
You know, I think we'll just
try again another time.

01:18:21.609 --> 01:18:22.959
When do you think
he'll be back?

01:18:25.918 --> 01:18:27.006
I don't know.

01:18:27.180 --> 01:18:28.704
OK, I don't know.

01:18:28.878 --> 01:18:29.922
Maybe never.

01:18:30.096 --> 01:18:31.663
I mean, I worry, OK?

01:18:31.837 --> 01:18:33.447
But that's my job.
I'm his dad.

01:18:33.621 --> 01:18:35.841
At least, I was his dad.

01:18:36.015 --> 01:18:38.148
Why did he have
to go and save China?

01:18:38.322 --> 01:18:39.627
I know why.

01:18:39.802 --> 01:18:41.194
But why?

01:18:41.368 --> 01:18:43.501
He's just one little panda.

01:18:46.286 --> 01:18:47.244
[giggles]

01:18:53.163 --> 01:18:54.468
Aaah!

01:18:58.995 --> 01:19:01.214
So, how did it go?

01:19:01.388 --> 01:19:02.738
Did you save China?

01:19:03.826 --> 01:19:05.218
Yep.

01:19:05.392 --> 01:19:07.655
Well, I knew you would.

01:19:07.830 --> 01:19:09.614
That's why I had
new signs made.

01:19:09.788 --> 01:19:11.964
"My son saved China.
You, too, can save.

01:19:12.138 --> 01:19:14.706
Buy one dumpling,
get one free."

01:19:14.880 --> 01:19:16.316
Hey, that's
a pretty good deal.

01:19:16.490 --> 01:19:19.015
- Would you like to try one?
- Maybe later.

01:19:20.407 --> 01:19:21.669
[sighs]

01:19:21.844 --> 01:19:23.889
There's something
I should tell you.

01:19:24.411 --> 01:19:25.412
[gulps]

01:19:26.674 --> 01:19:28.981
While I was gone,

01:19:29.155 --> 01:19:32.680
I found the village
where I was born.

01:19:32.855 --> 01:19:36.293
I found out how I ended up
in that radish basket.

01:19:36.946 --> 01:19:37.990
You did?

01:19:38.817 --> 01:19:40.427
I know who I am.

01:19:41.559 --> 01:19:42.647
You do?

01:19:44.780 --> 01:19:46.172
I'm your son.

01:19:52.526 --> 01:19:53.919
I love you, Dad.

01:19:55.529 --> 01:19:57.009
I love you, too, son.

01:20:00.012 --> 01:20:03.059
Ah. Delicious, fat radishes!

01:20:03.233 --> 01:20:05.496
You're probably hungry.
Let me make you
something to eat.

01:20:05.670 --> 01:20:07.367
What are you talking about?
I'll cook.

01:20:07.541 --> 01:20:09.065
- No, no, I'll cook.
- Dad!

01:20:09.239 --> 01:20:11.241
It's the least I can do.
You saved China.

01:20:11.415 --> 01:20:13.591
No, it's the least I can do.
You raised me.

01:20:13.765 --> 01:20:14.853
- Po.
- Dad.

01:20:15.027 --> 01:20:16.507
- Po!
- OK.

01:20:16.681 --> 01:20:18.465
Let's both cook.

01:20:18.639 --> 01:20:20.816
- Together.
- Together?

01:20:20.990 --> 01:20:22.426
No, I'll cook.

01:20:22.600 --> 01:20:24.471
[both chuckle]

01:20:57.461 --> 01:20:59.724
My son is alive!

01:21:16.262 --> 01:21:19.570
[up-tempo music]
